{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1002_p", "source_sha256": "53ef13d0ed3f62e57692b107e095b48b5fe77e9994282424c745742cf6db3805", "ja": "お疲れさま、環！\nずいぶん楽しそうだな？", "zh": "辛苦了，环！\n看起来相当开心嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
