{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3dde7b8bf718f312f3bbb1828a74a2cc382467ab4e1959c7dab924b548369a62", "ja": "うん、バッチリだよ。可愛いのに\n元気なイメージで、環にピッタリだな。", "zh": "嗯，非常合适哦。既可爱，\n又很有精神，太适合环了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "e8ef9fdeae20cb67950ff38a07283ea1a9424b8dce6a0704cd1052925ad38fca", "ja": "ありがとう、おやぶん！\nたまきもこの衣装、すっごく気に入った！", "zh": "谢谢老大！\n环也超级喜欢这套服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "70a6149e6ece80874fb121a12985d48f48547a2fb62cfaff892fac652059db1b", "ja": "かわいいし、動きやすそうだし……後ろの\nヒラヒラってしてるのが、かっこいいでしょ！", "zh": "又可爱，又好像很方便活动……而且后面飘飘的装饰也很帅，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f18f18fc3ce3d78ffdb61028a376b10fe143a54fb1b3cdfa66d9402e3136ad4b", "ja": "かっこいい……なるほど。\nたしかに、かっこいいかもしれないな！", "zh": "帅气……原来如此。\n确实，可能是挺帅气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "3be4db7ade4ae4ec852134bf7465bcd27f583250e1de5f5d2cc3428dcc2d2315", "ja": "くふふ！　早くファンのみんなに見せたいぞ～！\n育とももこも、おそろいなんだよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿！好想早点给粉丝们看看啊～！育和桃子也是同款，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1009_p", "source_sha256": "089e1c9d9bbc12d9a813e6a6686b0afea462e8bdb53722ce13b8847ce99ba916", "ja": "色やデザインは違うけど、イメージは揃えてるよ。\n次のライブは、3人がメインの予定だからな！", "zh": "虽然颜色和设计不同，但整体形象是一致的。下次演唱会预计由3人担任主角！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "50f6bd7872258fab869b577787aa7f9d174091e97b6b7dd297e06523ffedcd37", "ja": "うん！　ももこが、「メインアクトなんだから、\nしっかりしなきゃダメだよ」って言ってた！", "zh": "嗯！桃子说：“既然是主唱，就得好好表现，不能掉以轻心哦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "fba60600253433c74c2f4008c99d9729ae8c4b40e23ed85d8e6a61d08f2ec7d6", "ja": "でも、このみの歌、難しいんだぞ～。\nおやぶん、たまきが練習するの、聞いててくれる……？", "zh": "不过，这首歌是好难的哦～。老大，你能听着环练习吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1012_p", "source_sha256": "601a09dbc210d259325c8a4219c28682ecc12f8c3d1fb05c7b8b5f0c1acc7e0f", "ja": "もちろん！　けど環、今日は午前中も\nレッスンだったよな？　疲れてないか？", "zh": "当然！不过环，你今天上午也上过课吧？不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "9bf97f57bf098c6ab200987c9f9deb5913935698012f2ceb38153fd5bbae1a6e", "ja": "大丈夫！\nたまき、ぜんぜん疲れてないぞ～！", "zh": "没问题！\n环一点都不累哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "cda8382144aace2e5f02d1cba114a248ed86d23841ab1c2aa48ddde28e50f498", "ja": "元気いっぱいだから、歌もたくさん歌えるし、\nダンスだって踊れちゃうぞ～。", "zh": "因为精神满满的，所以能唱好多歌，\n跳舞也完全没问题哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5b9702c770e5cd70955cb1483937eff699a2f37aef8342dd133f2c2f55df5555", "ja": "はは、元気だな！　それだけ、次の公演が\n楽しみで待ちきれないって事かな？", "zh": "哈哈，真有精神啊！看来你是期待下一场演出，已经等不及了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "b46c0006f858a11986fb7fe32c9febc3e7c4f130de16a8109c3742809cc69bfd", "ja": "うん！　はやく次の公演になって欲しい！\n新しい衣装で、みんなとステージに立って……。", "zh": "嗯！真希望下一场公演快点到来！\n穿上新服装，和大家一起站上舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "ebf5b3725732747a9ae8e4210eadef53374ec7efc698d73301c2cb0cb9c73141", "ja": "それでファンのみんなのことも、い～っぱい\nニコニコにさせちゃうんだ～！", "zh": "还要让所有粉丝也都笑容满面～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1018_p", "source_sha256": "68358138cfce7c7304d8c526cc3b1d6284d8005e4a45fb0779a620e583051beb", "ja": "そうか。……なんだか環の話を聞いてたら、\n俺も早く環達のステージが見たくなったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。……听了小环她们说的话，我也突然想早点看到你们的舞台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0424_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "ad9b99d38df1cd1fa501815f455bdfabe5b88321a8edfd61642fbe574bf94c2c", "ja": "ほんと！？　じゃあたまきが今から歌うから、\nおやぶんはそこで見てて！", "zh": "真的！？那环现在就唱给你听，你要在那里看着哦，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
